 and who will swim as four bakers dive into baking cookies, cupcakes and a showpiece cake inspired by the deep blue sea. When six hours is up, host Buddy Valastro, Food Network Star Tregaye Fraser and Cake Boss sculptor Ralph Attanasia will award the most-impressive baker with a dream vacation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-29\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Roaring '20s\",\"overview\":\"Four bakers go back in time as they create cookies, cupcakes and a showpiece cake straight out of the 1920s. When the party's over, Buddy Valastro, pastry artist Dan Langan and founder of DO Cookie Dough Confections Kristen Tomlan will send the best baker on an all-expenses-paid vacation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-06\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Travel\",\"overview\":\"Four bakers take host Buddy Valastro and judges Thiago Silva and Aarti Sequeira on an incredible journey as they create cookies, cupcakes and a showpiece cake inspired by their travels. After six hours of intense competition, one baker's journey will continue as they embark on an all-expenses-paid, once-in-a-lifetime trip.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xn4D5LUX2ZTNSV2oB5tYn0xeICB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-13\",\"runtime\":41}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-06-08\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}